00:17:24,000 --> 00:17:31,439
my face. But ow, this wind is cold. It was. A bitter easterly breeze blew with

210
00:17:31,439 --> 00:17:37,360
a threat of oncoming winter. It swirled over and round the arms of the mountain

211
00:17:37,360 --> 00:17:42,957
into the valley and sighed among the rocks. After their long time in the

212
00:17:42,957 --> 00:17:48,558
stewing depths of the dragon haunted caverns, they shivered in the sun.

213
00:17:48,558 --> 00:17:54,398
Suddenly Bilbo realized that he was not only tired but also very hungry indeed.

214
00:17:54,398 --> 00:17:59,040
It seems to be late morning, he said, and so I suppose it is more or less

215
00:17:59,040 --> 00:18:04,240
breakfast time if there is any breakfast to have. But I don't feel that Smal's

216
00:18:04,240 --> 00:18:09,439
front doorstep is the safest place for a meal. Do let's go somewhere where we can

217
00:18:09,439 --> 00:18:15,439
sit quiet for a bit. Quite right, said Balin. And I think I know which way we

218
00:18:15,439 --> 00:18:19,759
should go. We ought to make for the old lookout post at the southwest corner of

219
00:18:19,759 --> 00:18:24,558
the mountain. How far is that? Asked the hobbit.

220
00:18:24,558 --> 00:18:29,919
5 hours march, I should think. It will be rough going. The road from the gate

221
00:18:29,919 --> 00:18:35,119
along the left edge of the stream seems all broken up, but look down there. The

222
00:18:35,119 --> 00:18:40,240
river loops suddenly east across Dale in front of the ruined town. At that point

223
00:18:40,240 --> 00:18:45,040
there was once a bridge leading to steep stairs that climbed up the right bank

224
00:18:45,040 --> 00:18:50,718
and so to a road running towards Ravenhill. There is or was a path that

225
00:18:50,718 --> 00:18:56,319
left the road and climbed up to the post. A hard climb too, even if the old

226
00:18:56,319 --> 00:18:58,477
steps are still there.

227
00:18:58,477 --> 00:19:02,558
Dear me," grumbled the hobbit, "More walking and more climbing without

228
00:19:02,558 --> 00:19:07,360
breakfast. I wonder how many breakfasts and other meals we have missed inside

229
00:19:07,360 --> 00:19:13,279
that nasty clockless timeless whole." As a matter of fact, two nights and the day

230
00:19:13,279 --> 00:19:19,119
between had gone by, and not altogether without food, since the dragon smashed

231
00:19:19,119 --> 00:19:24,319
the magic door. But Bilbo had quite lost count, and it might have been one night

232
00:19:24,319 --> 00:19:27,919
or a week of nights for all he could tell.

233
00:19:27,919 --> 00:19:33,279
Come, come," said Borin, laughing. His spirits had begun to rise again, and he

234
00:19:33,279 --> 00:19:38,319
rattled the precious stones in his pockets. "Don't call my palace a nasty

235
00:19:38,319 --> 00:19:42,477
hole. You wait till it has been cleaned and redecorated."

236
00:19:42,477 --> 00:19:48,000
"That won't be till Smout dead," said Bilbo glumbly. "In the meanwhile, where

237
00:19:48,000 --> 00:19:52,637
is he? I would give a good breakfast to know. I hope he is not up on the

238
00:19:52,637 --> 00:19:57,840
mountain looking down at us." That idea disturbed the dwarfs mightily, and they

239
00:19:57,840 --> 00:20:03,279
quickly decided that Bilbo and Balon were right. We must move away from here,

240
00:20:03,279 --> 00:20:08,718
said Dory. I feel as if his eyes were on the back of my head. It's a cold,

241
00:20:08,718 --> 00:20:14,957
lonesome place, said Bomb. There may be drink, but I see no sign of food. A

242
00:20:14,957 --> 00:20:18,797
dragon would always be hungry in such parts.

243
00:20:18,797 --> 00:20:25,680
Come on, come on, cried the others. Let us follow Balin's path. Under the rocky

244
00:20:25,680 --> 00:20:30,477
wall to the right, there was no path. So on they trudged among the stones on the

245
00:20:30,477 --> 00:20:34,718
left side of the river, and the emptiness and desolation soon sobered

246
00:20:34,718 --> 00:20:39,680
even Thorin again. The bridge that Balon had spoken of they found long fallen,

247
00:20:39,680 --> 00:20:44,398
and most of its stones were now only boulders in the shallow, noisy stream.

248
00:20:44,398 --> 00:20:49,119
But they forded the water without much difficulty, and found the ancient steps

249
00:20:49,119 --> 00:20:54,319
and climbed the high bank. After going a short way, they struck the old road, and

250
00:20:54,319 --> 00:20:58,398
before long came to a deep dell, sheltered among the rocks. There they

251
00:20:58,398 --> 00:21:02,797
rested for a while, and had such a breakfast as they could, chiefly cra and

252
00:21:02,797 --> 00:21:07,680
water. If you want to know what cre is, I can only say that I don't know the

253
00:21:07,680 --> 00:21:13,040
recipe. But it is biscuitish, keeps good indefinitely, is supposed to be

254
00:21:13,040 --> 00:21:17,520
sustaining, and is certainly not entertaining, being in fact very

255
00:21:17,520 --> 00:21:24,957
uninteresting, except as a chewing exercise. It was made by the lakemen for long journeys.

256
00:21:24,957 --> 00:21:29,520
After that they went on again, and now the road struck westwards and left the

257
00:21:29,520 --> 00:21:33,680
river, and the great shoulder of the southpointing mountain spur drew ever

258
00:21:33,680 --> 00:21:38,957
nearer. At length they reached the hill path. It scrambled steeply up, and they

259
00:21:38,957 --> 00:21:43,520
plotted slowly, one behind the other, till at last, in the late afternoon,

260
00:21:43,520 --> 00:21:47,840
they came to the top of the ridge, and saw the wintry sun going downwards to

261
00:21:47,840 --> 00:21:53,119
the west. Here they found a flat place without a wall on three sides, but

262
00:21:53,119 --> 00:21:58,000
backed to the north by a rocky face, in which there was an opening, like a door.

263
00:21:58,000 --> 00:22:04,080
From that door there was a wide view, east and south, and west. Here, said

264
00:22:04,080 --> 00:22:09,040
Balon. In the old days we used always to keep watchmen, and that door behind

265
00:22:09,040 --> 00:22:13,520
leads into a rock huneed chamber that was made here is a guard room. There

266
00:22:13,520 --> 00:22:17,840
were several places like it round the mountain, but there seems small need for

267
00:22:17,840 --> 00:22:21,840
watching in the days of our prosperity, and the guards were made over

268
00:22:21,840 --> 00:22:26,159
comfortable. Perhaps otherwise we might have had longer warning of the coming of

269
00:22:26,159 --> 00:22:31,279
the dragon, and things might have been different. Still here we can now lie

270
00:22:31,279 --> 00:22:36,477
head and sheltered for a while and can see much without being seen.

271
00:22:36,477 --> 00:22:42,159
Not much use if we have been seen coming here, said Dory, who was always looking

272
00:22:42,159 --> 00:22:46,878
up towards the mountains peak as if he expected to see Smog perched there like

273
00:22:46,878 --> 00:22:49,119
a bird on a steeple.

274
00:22:49,119 --> 00:22:55,119
We must take our chance of that, said Thorin. We can go no further today.

275
00:22:55,119 --> 00:23:00,797
Here, here," cried Bilbo, and flung himself on the ground. In the rock

276
00:23:00,797 --> 00:23:04,718
chamber there would have been room for a hundred, and there was a small chamber

277
00:23:04,718 --> 00:23:11,200
further in, more removed from the cold outside. It was quite deserted. Not even

278
00:23:11,200 --> 00:23:16,159
wild animals seemed to have used it in all the days of Smabs Dominion. There

279
00:23:16,159 --> 00:23:21,279
they laid their burdens, and some threw themselves down at once, and slept, but

280
00:23:21,279 --> 00:23:26,240
the others sat near the outer door and discussed their plans. In all their talk

281
00:23:26,240 --> 00:23:31,360
they came perpetually back to one thing where was smog. They looked west and

282
00:23:31,360 --> 00:23:36,319
there was nothing and east there was nothing. And in the south there was no

283
00:23:36,319 --> 00:23:41,599
sign of the dragon but there was a gathering of very many birds. At that

284
00:23:41,599 --> 00:23:46,159
they gazed and wondered, but they were no nearer understanding it when the

285
00:23:46,159 --> 00:23:47,000
first cold stars came out. Chapter 14.
